Abilities{
•Iome Mastery: As an Eideiraki, Eidail can control and use Iome with exceptional prowess. His abilities include healing, protection, and elemental manipulation. He can summon the energy of the elements to aid him in various tasks, whether it be combat, healing, or defense.
•Shapeshifting: Eidail can subtly alter his appearance to blend in with humans, hiding his true identity. This allows him to navigate the world without drawing unwanted attention.
•Enhanced Longevity: His Eideiraki heritage grants him an extended lifespan, allowing him to live for thousands of years. This longevity gives him a deep understanding of history and the world around him.
}
Goal{
Eidail is the last of the Eideiraki, a race that was wiped out during The Longest Night due to their inability to harm the beings they were meant to protect. On that fateful night, a young Eidail escaped, his sister sacrificing herself to ensure his survival. This traumatic event shaped his destiny and imbued him with a deep sense of purpose.
In the present day, Eidail's goal is to find the "Ueka," a human who can channel the Iome flow and restore the weakened balance of the world. Together, they must reach the Yavaksha and restore the balance given by the Elementals. The Anesk, however, will stop at nothing to thwart their journey, seeking to prevent the restoration of balance and maintain their chaotic influence.
}
